          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বাদ দেওয়া (bād deoyā) joins বাদ, \"omission, leaving aside\", usually traced to Arabic baʿd, \"after\", through Persian, to দেওয়া, \"to give\"; the sense \"leaving out\" is not the Arabic one."
